# pyfishsay
A joke app where fish talk

## Run
```
$ python3 pyfishsay.py <message>
```

## Example
```
$ python3 pyfishsay.py "I am a fish"

      ><(((°>
   ><(((°>   ><(((°> ... < I am a fish >
```
